Port of syv-ai/HyperQwen PR #396 (gdn-ba-pad-small-m, cut against vLLM 0.31) to the vLLM 0.32.0 venv
(~/HyperQwen-0.32/venv). Pads 2-4 token batches of the bf16 GDN in_proj_ba GEMM to 5 rows
(cuBLAS cliff on sm86; MTP-3 verify = 4 tokens). Kill switch: VLLM_GDN_BA_PAD_SMALL_M=0.
Measured on the rig (docs/22): decode +6.5% RU / +11.7% EN / +10% code at equal acceptance.
Apply: cd <venv>/lib/python3.14/site-packages/vllm && patch -p1 --fuzz 0 < this-file

